            "DialogCategory": "Growup",
            "VoiceClip": "Shigure_Growup_1",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_Shigure/shigure_growup_1",
            "LocalizeEN": "Thank you, Sensei. I think it would be better to ferment something as a token of appreciation."
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10055,
            "DialogCategory": "Growup",
            "VoiceClip": "Shigure_Growup_2",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_Shigure/shigure_growup_2",
            "LocalizeEN": "I feel bad to always receive help from you. I want to do something for you in return."
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10055,
            "DialogCategory": "Growup",
            "VoiceClip": "Shigure_Growup_3",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_Shigure/shigure_growup_3",
            "LocalizeEN": "Is this really okay? I'm happy."
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10055,
            "DialogCategory": "Growup",
            "VoiceClip": "Shigure_Growup_4",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_Shigure/shigure_growup_4",
            "LocalizeEN": "I have gotten so much from you, Sensei. I will do my best for you."
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10055,
            "DialogCategory": "Relationship",
            "VoiceClip": "Shigure_Relationship_Up_1",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_Shigure/shigure_relationship_up_1",
            "LocalizeEN": "It's not that I dislike it, but I may not deserve this feeling.<ref group=\"note\">[[wikt:似合う|似合う]] can mean match or suit, so this sentence could be translated as \"this feeling does not suit me\". Using \"suit\" or \"match\" in the translation is, however, ambiguous, so the word is interpreted as \"deserve\" here.</ref>"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10055,
            "DialogCategory": "Relationship",
            "VoiceClip": "Shigure_Relationship_Up_2",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_Shigure/shigure_relationship_up_2",
            "LocalizeEN": "I'm always grateful to you, Sensei, for accepting someone like me."
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10055,
            "DialogCategory": "Relationship",
            "VoiceClip": "Shigure_Relationship_Up_3",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_Shigure/shigure_relationship_up_3",
            "LocalizeEN": "I feel kind of good. Don't tell Nodoka."
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10055,
            "DialogCategory": "Relationship",
            "VoiceClip": "Shigure_Relationship_Up_4",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_Shigure/shigure_relationship_up_4",
